  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/school-store.webp",
    "alt": "下課時間熱鬧的校園福利社裡，男學生在櫃檯前拿著點心與果汁準備結帳，店員在收銀機旁親切微笑服務。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "During the break, Kevin walks into the school "
        },
        {
          "text": "store",
          "wordIds": [
            "store"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "下課時間，Kevin 走進學校福利社。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He is hungry and asks the clerk, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Can I get a ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "can-i-get-a-snack"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "snack",
          "phraseIds": [
            "can-i-get-a-snack"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "snack"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "can-i-get-a-snack"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他肚子餓了，便問店員：「我可以買個點心嗎？」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "After choosing a bun, Kevin asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Where are the drinks?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "where-are-the-drinks"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "挑好一個麵包後，Kevin 問道：「飲料在哪裡？」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He finds a cold "
        },
        {
          "text": "bottle",
          "wordIds": [
            "bottle"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " in the fridge and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "How much is this ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "how-much-is-this-juice"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "juice",
          "phraseIds": [
            "how-much-is-this-juice"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "juice"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "how-much-is-this-juice"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他在冰箱裡拿了一瓶冰涼的飲料，並問：「這瓶果汁多少錢？」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“The "
        },
        {
          "text": "price",
          "wordIds": [
            "price"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " is thirty dollars,” the clerk answers with a smile."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "店員微笑著回答：「價格是三十元。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Kevin hands her a fifty-dollar coin and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Keep the ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "keep-the-change"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "change",
          "phraseIds": [
            "keep-the-change"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "change"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "keep-the-change"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Kevin 遞給她一枚五十元硬幣並說：「不用找零了。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The clerk laughs, gives him twenty dollars, and says, “Take your "
        },
        {
          "text": "change",
          "wordIds": [
            "change"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and enjoy your "
        },
        {
          "text": "snack",
          "wordIds": [
            "snack"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "!”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "店員笑著找給他二十元，並說：「收下你的零錢，好好享用點心吧！」"
    }
  ],
